      "status": "not_affected",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-05T00:00:00Z",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The flaw is in the header-only binary-heap priority-queue template (erase_if). Template code is compiled into consumers; the shared runtime libraries (libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libatomic1) do not contain it, no libstdc++ headers are installed, and no binary in the image is built from that container."
