      ],
      "status": "under_investigation",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-05T00:00:00Z",
      "status_notes": "Integer overflow in libstdc++'s aligned operator new. The C++ consumers are HarfBuzz/Pango (WeasyPrint report rendering) and, in the worker, OpenSCAP. Whether an attacker-sized aligned allocation is reachable from report data has not been established; tracking the Debian fix."
    },
